        <briefdescription>
<para>Extracts the statistics of each top-level column of the finished file. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>They must equal what <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_format_stats_extractor_1a286589bfa52690e64d144d95d0c8bc76" kindref="member">FormatStatsExtractor::Extract()</ref></computeroutput> reads back from that file.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>pool</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Memory pool used to build the statistics. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The statistics, or an error status if the file has not been finished successfully. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
