    <briefdescription>
<para>Optionally implemented by a <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_format_writer" kindref="compound">FormatWriter</ref></computeroutput> that can produce the column statistics of the file it has finished from the metadata it still holds in memory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The data file writers then take the statistics from it instead of reopening the file through <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_format_stats_extractor" kindref="compound">FormatStatsExtractor</ref></computeroutput> to read them back.</para>
<para>It is implemented alongside <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_format_writer" kindref="compound">FormatWriter</ref></computeroutput> rather than added to it, so <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_format_writer" kindref="compound">FormatWriter</ref></computeroutput> keeps its ABI and format writers that do not implement it are unaffected. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
